    <string name="setup_header">Termux Installation Helper</string>
    <string name="setup_step1_title">1. Configure Termux Permissions</string>
    <string name="setup_step1_desc">Ensure your Termux properties allow external apps.\n\nIn Termux, run:\necho \"allow-external-apps = true\" &gt;&gt; ~/.termux/termux.properties\ntermux-reload-settings\n\nAlso grant \"Run commands in Termux\" permission in Android Settings → Apps → Plain-UB Dashboard → Permissions.</string>
    <string name="setup_step2_title">2. Automate Environment Build</string>
    <string name="setup_step2_desc">This step automatically downloads Python, Git, and system libraries inside Termux, clones the plain-ub repository, generates the config.env, and installs all required packages using the Termux-specific script.</string>

